export function PollOption({label,votes,percent,onVote}:{label:string;votes:number;percent:number;onVote:()=>void}){return <li><button type="button" onClick={onVote}>{label}</button><meter aria-label={`Udział głosów: ${label}`} min={0} max={100} value={percent}/>{percent}% ({votes})</li>;}
export function Poll(){const [votes,setVotes]=useState<Votes>({react:0,vue:0,svelte:0});const total=Object.values(votes).reduce((sum,count)=>sum+count,0);return <section><ul>{FRAMEWORKS.map(key=><PollOption key={key} label={LABELS[key]} votes={votes[key]} percent={total===0?0:Math.round(votes[key]/total*100)} onVote={()=>setVotes(previous=>({...previous,[key]:previous[key]+1}))}/>)}</ul><p>Łącznie głosów: {total}</p></section>;}

import {useState} from "react";
const STEPS=["Dane","Opcje","Podsumowanie"] as const;
export function Wizard(){const [step,setStep]=useState(0);return <section><h2>Krok {step+1}: {STEPS[step]}</h2><button type="button" disabled={step===0} onClick={()=>setStep(previous=>Math.max(0,previous-1))}>Wstecz</button><button type="button" disabled={step===STEPS.length-1} onClick={()=>setStep(previous=>Math.min(STEPS.length-1,previous+1))}>Dalej</button><button type="button" onClick={()=>setStep(0)}>Od początku</button></section>;}

import {useState} from "react";
export type Product=Readonly<{id:number;name:string;priceGrosze:number}>;
export type Cart=Readonly<Partial<Record<number,number>>>;
export function addUnit(cart:Cart,id:number):Cart{return {...cart,[id]:(cart[id]??0)+1};}
export function removeUnit(cart:Cart,id:number):Cart{const quantity=cart[id]??0;if(quantity===0)return cart;const next={...cart};if(quantity===1)delete next[id];else next[id]=quantity-1;return next;}
export function cartCount(cart:Cart):number{return Object.values(cart).reduce<number>((sum,quantity)=>sum+(quantity??0),0);}
export function cartTotal(cart:Cart,products:readonly Product[]):number{return products.reduce((sum,product)=>sum+(cart[product.id]??0)*product.priceGrosze,0);}
export function CartDemo({products}:{products:readonly Product[]}){const [cart,setCart]=useState<Cart>({});return <section><p>Sztuk: {cartCount(cart)}</p><p>Razem: {(cartTotal(cart,products)/100).toLocaleString("pl-PL",{style:"currency",currency:"PLN"})}</p><ul>{products.map(product=><li key={product.id}>{product.name}: {cart[product.id]??0}<button type="button" onClick={()=>setCart(previous=>addUnit(previous,product.id))}>+</button><button type="button" disabled={(cart[product.id]??0)===0} onClick={()=>setCart(previous=>removeUnit(previous,product.id))}>−</button></li>)}</ul></section>;}

